---
import LegalLayout from '@/layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { brandFor } from '@/config/brand';

const brand = brandFor('en');
---

<LegalLayout title="Privacy policy" updated="July 2026" path="/privacidad">
  <h2>1. Data controller</h2>
  <p>
    The controller of the data collected through this site is Cogniplex SL, with registered office
    in Barcelona (Spain). You can contact us at
    <a href={`mailto:${brand.email}`}>{brand.email}</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>2. What data we process and for what purpose</h2>
  <p>
    We process the data you voluntarily provide through the contact or assessment request form
    (name, role, email, company and the message you send us), for the purpose of handling your
    request and, where applicable, maintaining the business relationship.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Legal basis</h2>
  <p>
    The legal basis is your consent when submitting the form and the legitimate interest of
    {brand.name} in responding to your request.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Retention</h2>
  <p>
    We keep your data for as long as necessary to handle your request and, where applicable, for
    the duration of the business relationship, unless you request its erasure.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Recipients</h2>
  <p>
    Form submissions are sent directly to our corporate email. If in the future we use an external
    form provider, it will act as a data processor and will be identified in this policy. We do not
    share your data with third parties except where legally required.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You can exercise your rights of access, rectification, erasure, objection, restriction and
    portability by writing to <a href={`mailto:${brand.email}`}>{brand.email}</a>. You can also
    lodge a complaint with the Spanish Data Protection Agency (AEPD).
  </p>

</LegalLayout>
